# mirrors: an off-center ball inside a mirrored cube
# Intended camera: position (1.5, 1.5, -0.1), forward (0, 0, -1)
# The six planes form an 8 x 8 x 8 box centered on the camera.

mtllib scene.mtl

usemtl Mirror
plane -2.5  1.5 -0.1  1  0  0
plane  5.5  1.5 -0.1 -1  0  0
plane  1.5 -2.5 -0.1  0  1  0
plane  1.5  5.5 -0.1  0 -1  0
plane  1.5  1.5 -4.1  0  0  1
plane  1.5  1.5  3.9  0  0 -1

# A warm ball below and to the right of the box center.
usemtl WarmBall
S 2.4 0.3 -2.5 0.75

# Cool overhead key and warm side fill, both inside the enclosure.
P -0.75 4.25 -1.25 0.55 0.72 1.00
P  4.25 0.25  1.25 0.90 0.48 0.25
